# Cotton flatweave bed rug (issue 166): cream with fine pinstripes, a rope-twist border in putty and cream, short fringe. Seen from above like the floor: flat, ink outline, palette only, no print or text. 7x3 tiles. Lies on the floor under the furniture and the player.
size: 112x48
